{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12792","headline":"赠别上元主簿张着 · 韩翃","name":"赠别上元主簿张着","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上书一见平津侯，劒笏斜齐秣陵尉。\n朝垂绶带迎远客，暮锁印囊飞上吏。\n长乐花深万井时，同官无事有归期。\n回船对酒三生渚，系马焚香五愿祠。\n日日澄江带山翠，绿芳都在经过地。\n行人看射领军堂，游女题诗光宅寺。\n风流才调爱君偏，此别相逢定几年。\n惆怅浮云迷远道，张侯楼上月娟娟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}